{"4467390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ChronoQuest VR", "steam_appid": 4467390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ChronoQuest VR is a narrative virtual reality adventure inspired by classic graphic adventures.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across historical eras, interact with key characters, and solve a wide variety of puzzles using observation, logic, and objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a casual experience. ChronoQuest VR is designed for players who enjoy thinking within a coherent world and discovering its rules through exploration and dialogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure spans multiple historical settings, each with its own atmosphere, characters, and challenges. Progress depends on attention, reasoning, and curiosity rather than reflexes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Narrative-driven time travel adventure <br>• Exploration of multiple historical eras <br>• Dialogue-based progression and problem solving <br>• Logic, observation, and object-based puzzles <br>• Designed for experienced VR and adventure game players</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Platform</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PC VR — Compatible with SteamVR and Meta Link <br>Works with most PC VR headsets supporting SteamVR.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content Notice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains strong language, depictions of violence, alcohol consumption, and non-explicit sexual content.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Difficulty Notice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This experience is designed for advanced VR and adventure game users. It may be challenging or frustrating for casual or novice players.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ChronoQuest VR is a narrative virtual reality adventure inspired by classic graphic adventures.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across historical eras, interact with key characters, and solve a wide variety of puzzles using observation, logic, and objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a casual experience. ChronoQuest VR is designed for players who enjoy thinking within a coherent world and discovering its rules through exploration and dialogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure spans multiple historical settings, each with its own atmosphere, characters, and challenges. Progress depends on attention, reasoning, and curiosity rather than reflexes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Narrative-driven time travel adventure <br>• Exploration of multiple historical eras <br>• Dialogue-based progression and problem solving <br>• Logic, observation, and object-based puzzles <br>• Designed for experienced VR and adventure game players</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Platform</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PC VR — Compatible with SteamVR and Meta Link <br>Works with most PC VR headsets supporting SteamVR.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content Notice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains strong language, depictions of violence, alcohol consumption, and non-explicit sexual content.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Difficulty Notice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This experience is designed for advanced VR and adventure game users. It may be challenging or frustrating for casual or novice players.</p>", "short_description": "Narrative VR adventure inspired by classic graphic adventures. Explore historical eras, interact with characters, and solve story-driven puzzles through dialogue and immersive environments. Designed for experienced players who enjoy story-driven challenges.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4467390/9aada57a74c0b75a319412122e51aea795d49d01/header.jpg?t=1785402368", "capsule_image": "https://s